      "sequence_id": 1,
      "text": "1. More key words in comprehending directions\n\nThe following words are useful for comprehending directions:\n\nmassugu       straight                  e.g., massugu itte           going straight\nmichi         street                    e.g., kono michi             this street\n...no hoo     toward...                 e.g., migi no hoo            to(ward) the right\n...no saki    beyond...                 e.g., koosaten no saki       beyond the intersection\ntsukiatari    end (of a street)         e.g., Kono michi no tsukiatari desu.\n                                              It's at the end of this street."
    }
